  "title": {
   "en": "HOW IT EARNS CASH | BUSINESS CHAIN",
   "zh": "现金生成路径"
  },
  "lines": {
   "en": [
    "1 Insure | Aetna collects premiums for ~26M medical members; MBR sets the margin.",
    "2 Manage | Caremark PBM serves ~87M plan members; 473M claims in Q2'26.",
    "3 Dispense | ~9,000 pharmacies and >1,000 clinics; Q2'26 scripts +4.3%.",
    "4 Integrate | One member can be insured, managed and filled in-house.",
    "5 Collect | OCF $10.6B - cash PP&E $2.8B = FCF $7.8B -> debt, dividend."
   ],
   "zh": [
    "1 承保 | Aetna 向约 2,600 万医疗会员收取保费；MBR 决定利润率。",
    "2 管理 | Caremark PBM 服务约 8,700 万计划会员；Q2'26 处理 4.73 亿笔理赔。",
    "3 配药 | 约 9,000 家药房、1,000 余家诊所；Q2'26 处方量 +4.3%。",
    "4 整合 | 同一会员可在体系内完成投保、福利管理与取药。",
    "5 回款 | OCF $10.6B - 现金PP&E $2.8B = FCF $7.8B → 还债、股息。"
   ]
  },
