 "lead_paragraphs": [
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "CAPITAL RETURNS:",
    "zh": "现金分配："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "FY11-25 OCF $158.3B less cash PP&E $35.4B yielded **$123.0B FCF**. Buybacks **$37.7B (30.6%)**; dividends **$32.1B (26.1%)**; payout **56.7%**. Acquisitions took **$78.8B (64.1%)** — Aetna $42.2B, Omnicare $11.5B, Oak Street/Signify $16.6B — funded partly with debt.",
    "zh": "FY11-25 OCF $158.3B 减现金PP&E $35.4B，得 **FCF $123.0B**。回购 **$37.7B（30.6%）**；股息 **$32.1B（26.1%）**；分配率 **56.7%**。收购耗用 **$78.8B（64.1%）**——Aetna $42.2B、Omnicare $11.5B、Oak Street/Signify $16.6B——部分依靠举债。"
   }
  },
  {
   "label": {
    "en": "NET SHARES:",
    "zh": "净股数变化："
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "Diluted shares FY10 1,377M to FY25 1,271M, **down 106M (7.7%)**. Buybacks cut the count to 1,024M by FY17; the Aetna stock consideration lifted it to 1,305M in FY19. No repurchases in FY25 or the 2026 plan; debt $64.6B at FY25-end.",
    "zh": "稀释股数由 FY10 的 1,377M 降至 FY25 的 1,271M，**减少 106M（7.7%）**。回购曾把股数压到 FY17 的 1,024M；收购 Aetna 的换股使 FY19 回升至 1,305M。FY25 与 2026 年计划均无回购；FY25 末债务 $64.6B。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "commentary": [
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Margin, not revenue, is the story.",
    "zh": "故事在利润率，不在收入。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Revenue grew 7.8% to $402.1B in FY25, yet adjusted operating margin is only 3.6%. Each 10bp of margin is ~$0.4B of operating income. The 2026 guide (~3.9%) moves EPS far more than sales do. My model holds revenue growth near 5% a year and lets margin do the work.",
    "zh": "FY25 营收增长 7.8% 至 $402.1B，调整后营业利润率却只有 3.6%。利润率每提升 10bp，约带来 $0.4B 营业利润。2026 年指引（约 3.9%）对 EPS 的推动远大于收入增长。这是一个利润率修复的故事，不需要激进的收入假设。我的模型把收入增速维持在每年约 5%，主要靠利润率修复。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Aetna is the swing factor.",
    "zh": "Aetna 是摇摆因素。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "HCB adjusted operating income rose from $0.31B (FY24) to $2.94B (FY25) and 85.5% YoY in Q2'26 as MBR fell to 87.4%. About $0.5B of that quarter was prior-year development; the full-year MBR guide is 89.75%, not 87.4%. The test is whether pricing and cost management hold once that tailwind fades.",
    "zh": "HCB 调整后营业利润由 FY24 的 $0.31B 升至 FY25 的 $2.94B；Q2'26 同比 +85.5%，MBR 降至 87.4%。其中约 $0.5B 来自往年准备金有利变动；全年 MBR 指引为 89.75%，而非 87.4%。真正的检验是：这股顺风消退后，定价和成本管理能否守住利润率。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Caremark carries the policy risk.",
    "zh": "政策风险集中在 Caremark。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Health Services earned $7.15B in FY25 on $190.4B revenue, a 3.8% margin. The July 2026 FTC settlement, rebate-model changes and client price give-backs can compress it even as volume holds. Watch client retention and 340B pressure.",
    "zh": "健康服务 FY25 营收 $190.4B、调整后营业利润 $7.15B，利润率 3.8%。2026年7月的 FTC 和解、返利模式调整和客户让价，即使在量稳的情况下也可能压缩利润率。需关注客户留存与 340B 带来的压力；若专科药业务无法抵消，分散化的价值会打折扣。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "Cash must cut debt first.",
    "zh": "现金必须先用于降债。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "1H26 OCF was $10.6B vs $6.5B; after $1.5B capex, $3.3B repaid debt and $1.7B paid dividends. With ~$61.4B debt and ~3.5x leverage, buybacks stay off until the turnaround is proven. 1H26 cash after capex was ~$9.0B, enough to keep paying down debt.",
    "zh": "1H26 OCF $10.6B（上年 $6.5B）；扣除 $1.5B 资本开支后，$3.3B 用于偿债、$1.7B 用于股息。债务约 $61.4B、杠杆约 3.5x，在复苏得到证实前不会恢复回购。1H26 扣除资本开支后的现金约 $9.0B，足以继续降债。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "2027 is the real test.",
    "zh": "2027 年才是真正的检验。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Guidance rose twice to $7.90-8.10 EPS, yet the stock fell ~6% after Q2 on a ≥$8.44 2027 floor. Q3 commentary and the full 2027 guide must show the Aetna gains are repeatable. A miss would leave the multiple where it is. The floor is ~13% above the normalized $7.46 base, so the bar is higher than it looks.",
    "zh": "EPS 指引两次上调至 $7.90-8.10，但因 2027 年下限仅为 ≥$8.44，股价在 Q2 后下跌约 6%。Q3 的表态和完整的 2027 年指引必须证明 Aetna 的改善可以持续。若 2027 年指引低于下限，估值倍数很难修复，基准情景需要下调。这一下限比正常化后的 $7.46 基数高约 13%，门槛比表面更高。"
   }
  },
  {
   "headline": {
    "en": "The price asks for durability, not growth.",
    "zh": "股价要的是持续性，不是增长。"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "My $115 base needs only 13.5-14x the 2027 EPS floor; at $89.35 the stock trades ~10.6x. The 8.0x exit DCF gives $131.83. I sit 4.5% above Morningstar ($110) on a more durable Aetna margin. Bear/base/bull of $80/$115/$132 at 25/50/25% weights to $110.50, +23.7% vs price.",
    "zh": "基准价值 $115 只需 2027 年 EPS 下限的 13.5-14 倍；现价 $89.35 约为 10.6 倍。8.0x 退出倍数 DCF 得出 $131.83。我对 Aetna 利润率的持续性更有信心，因此比 Morningstar（$110）高 4.5%。悲观/基准/乐观 $80/$115/$132，按 25/50/25% 加权为 $110.50，较现价 +23.7%。"
   }
  }
 ],
 "footnotes": {
  "en": [
   "FY11-25 from SEC 10-K XBRL (as restated); price Nov 13, 2026; FY21-25 P/E, FCF/dividend yield and Mkt cap* from StockAnalysis (FY-end basis).",
   "Gross Margin* = (revenue - cost of products sold - health care costs) / revenue; includes Aetna from 11/2018. FCF = OCF - cash PP&E. Dividend/Sh.* = dividends paid / diluted shares.",
   "ROIC* = op. income x (1-25%) / (equity + debt - cash & ST investments), year-end. ROE/ROA on year-end balances. NM* = not meaningful (FY18 loss).",
   "AOI and segment data from CVS releases via the Pythia model; MBR (Q2)* is the Q2 quarter. Header: TTM P/E and P/FCF, FY25 book/share. Price history before FY21 not loaded.",
   "DCF: Pythia model (valuation date Sep 23, 2026; WACC 6.69%; 8.0x exit). Scenarios $80/$115/$132 at 25/50/25%. Morningstar FV Aug 5, 2026; S&P GMI = consensus avg. target, Sep 2026.",
   "Sources: CVS 10-K/10-Q, Q2 2026 release and transcript, 2025 Investor Day; SEC EDGAR; StockAnalysis; Morningstar."
  ],
  "zh": [
   "FY11-25 数据取自 SEC 10-K XBRL（以重述后为准）；价格为 2026年11月13日；FY21-25 的 P/E、FCF/股息收益率与市值*取自 StockAnalysis（年末口径）。",
   "毛利率* =（营收 - 产品销售成本 - 医疗成本）/ 营收；自 2018年11月起含 Aetna。FCF = OCF - 现金PP&E。每股股息* = 已付股息 / 稀释股数。",
   "ROIC* = 营业利润 ×（1-25%）/（权益 + 债务 - 现金及短期投资），年末口径。ROE/ROA 按年末余额。NM* = 无意义（FY18 亏损）。",
   "调整后营业利润与分部数据来自 CVS 公告（经 Pythia 模型整理）；MBR（Q2）* 为第二季度数据。首行：TTM P/E 与 P/FCF，FY25 每股账面价值。FY21 以前的股价历史未载入。",
